{"product_id":"world-war-i-eyewitness","title":"World War I (Eyewitness)","description":"\u003cp\u003eEngaging and entertaining reference guide to World War I From disaster to victory, Eyewitness World War I captivates readers and gives an insight into life in the muddy trenches, and what it was like to be a soldier, along with a broader picture of the world-changing events that led to the start of the conflict. Stunning real-life photographs, illustrating the people, places and stories, give you a unique eyewitness view of the conflict dubbed the \"war to end all wars.\" This book also includes a fantastic giant wall chart and over 250 evocative photographs perfect for bedrooms or classrooms. DK Eyewitness World War I provides the perfect combination of information and great ideas for school projects. Children will learn about World War I and how it changed the world.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 217 x 279\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kindersley Dorling | Simon Adams | Imperial War Museum\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781409343660\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 72\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675036377241,"sku":"BLK-49781409343660","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/518bHEn6qqL._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1756282946","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/world-war-i-eyewitness","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}